---
import { getPosts } from '~/utils'

const posts = await getPosts()
const postCount = posts.length
---

<section class="frontispiece-section grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 mb-14 py-4">
  <!-- 左侧：经典排版引言 (7 列) -->
  <div class="md:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--paper-rust)]"></span>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-mono tracking-widest uppercase text-[var(--paper-muted)]"
          >OPENING EPIGRAPH · 题记</span
        >
      </div>
      <blockquote
        class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-[26px] leading-[1.55] text-[var(--uno-colors-primary)] mb-4 font-normal m-0"
      >
        “写文字，做创造。<br />在喧嚣的网络里，留下一座持续生长、与自己真诚对话的数字花园。”
      </blockquote>
      <p class="text-[14px] text-[var(--paper-sub)] leading-relaxed max-w-lg mb-6 font-sans m-0">
        陈（Teclado），00 后开发者，生活在深圳。专注探索 AI Harness
        运行时架构与产品级工作区设计，同时在此记录阅读的温度与生活切片的沉思。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-[var(--paper-muted)] font-mono pt-3 border-t border-[var(--paper-border)]"
    >
      <span>INFJ</span>
      <span class="opacity-50">·</span>
      <span>全栈工程</span>
      <span class="opacity-50">·</span>
      <span>AI 实践</span>
      <span class="opacity-50">·</span>
      <a href="/about" class="text-[var(--paper-rust)] hover:underline font-serif not-underline-hover"
        >阅读作者手记 ↗</a
      >
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 右侧：编者札记与读书感悟 (5 列) -->
  <div class="md:col-span-5 frontispiece-box p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
    <div>
      <div
        class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3 text-[10.5px] font-mono tracking-wider text-[var(--paper-muted)] uppercase"
      >
        <span>FIELD NOTE 札记</span>
        <span class="text-[var(--paper-rust)] font-semibold">NO. 08</span>
      </div>
      <div
        class="font-serif italic text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--uno-colors-primary)] mb-4 pl-3 border-l-2 border-[var(--paper-rust)]"
      >
        “世界上有一句话，能顶得上一万句；有万语千言，不如一次真正的触动。”
        <div class="text-xs text-[var(--paper-muted)] font-sans not-italic mt-2">— 刘震云《一句顶一万句》重读笔记</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-4 border-t border-[var(--paper-border)] text-xs space-y-2 font-sans">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[var(--paper-muted)]">
        <span>当前状态：</span>
        <span class="text-[var(--uno-colors-primary)] font-medium">探索跨仓库契约治理</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[var(--paper-muted)]">
        <span>全站馆藏：</span>
        <span class="text-[var(--uno-colors-primary)] font-mono tabular">{postCount} 篇文章 · 深度实践</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .frontispiece-box {
    background-color: var(--paper-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--paper-border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
</style>
